                  "# Brightwave - Unity AI Gateway - Executive Usage Report\n",
                  "\n",
                  "Every AI surface at Brightwave is governed through the **Unity AI Gateway**: the **Campaign Desk app** (model service `campaign_desk_llm`), the **coding agent** (Codex via ucode), and the **Slack MCP** (`system.ai.slack`). All calls are traced in `system.ai_gateway.usage` and capped by a **$0.05 Unity AI Gateway budget (Block usage)**. The app's model service also enforces the `block_all_lakebase_data` guardrail (its LLM-judge calls appear as *Guardrail Judge*)."
                ]
              }
